  "cues" : [
    {
      "end" : 2.8199999999999998,
      "speaker" : "Locutor 1",
      "start" : 0,
      "text" : "Even so, the big man's still waiting things out."
    },
    {
      "end" : 8.3399999999999999,
      "speaker" : "Locutor 1",
      "start" : 2.8199999999999998,
      "text" : "I'm, of course, referring to my comrade, the leader of all revolutionaries in the world."
    },
    {
      "end" : 15.779999999999999,
      "speaker" : "Locutor 1",
      "start" : 11.99,
      "text" : "You may know him as Dragon."
    },
    {
      "end" : 17.579999999999998,
      "speaker" : "Locutor 2",
      "start" : 15.779999999999999,
      "text" : "Oh, you're talking about my dad."
    },
    {
      "end" : 19.739999999999998,
      "speaker" : "Locutor 1",
      "start" : 17.579999999999998,
      "text" : "Yes, that's the plan."
    },
    {
      "end" : 22.02,
      "speaker" : "Locutor 1",
      "start" : 19.739999999999998,
      "text" : "When your dad makes a move with that army of his."
    },
    {
      "end" : 24.600000000000001,
      "speaker" : "Locutor 1",
      "start" : 22.02,
      "text" : "Then I shall do some maneuvering of my own."
    },
    {
      "end" : 27.120000000000001,
      "speaker" : "Locutor 1",
      "start" : 24.600000000000001,
      "text" : "Call it my grand comeback tour."
    },
    {
      "end" : 29.879999999999999,
      "speaker" : "Locutor 1",
      "start" : 27.120000000000001,
      "text" : "If I were to escape from this place now."
    },
    {
      "end" : 33.359999999999999,
      "speaker" : "Locutor 1",
      "start" : 29.879999999999999,
      "text" : "I just end up on a sea of wanted lists."
    },
    {
      "end" : 40.229999999999997,
      "speaker" : null,
      "start" : 39.229999999999997,
      "text" : "Dad"
    },
    {
      "end" : 51.479999999999997,
      "speaker" : "Locutor 1",
      "start" : 49.009999999999998,
      "text" : "Oh, dear Papa."
    },
    {
      "end" : 54.119999999999997,
      "speaker" : "Locutor 1",
      "start" : 51.890000000000001,
      "text" : "And I never knew."
    },
    {
      "end" : 55.380000000000003,
      "speaker" : "Locutor 1",
      "start" : 54.119999999999997,
      "text" : "Goodness!"
    },
    {
      "end" : 60.840000000000003,
      "speaker" : "Locutor 1",
      "start" : 58.25,
      "text" : "D d d don't be ridiculous!"
    },
    {
      "end" : 62.640000000000001,
      "speaker" : "Locutor 1",
      "start" : 60.840000000000003,
      "text" : "Dragon doesn't have any children?"
    },
    {
      "end" : 64.319999999999993,
      "speaker" : "Locutor 1",
      "start" : 62.640000000000001,
      "text" : "That's just crazy talk."
    },
    {
      "end" : 68.099999999999994,
      "speaker" : "Locutor 2",
      "start" : 65.569999999999993,
      "text" : "Maybe I shouldn't have said anything."
    },
    {
      "end" : 70.980000000000004,
      "speaker" : "Locutor 2",
      "start" : 68.930000000000007,
      "text" : "Ah, whatever."
    },
    {
      "end" : 73.019999999999996,
      "speaker" : "Locutor 2",
      "start" : 70.980000000000004,
      "text" : "Grandpa didn't keep it a secret."
    },
    {
      "end" : 77.459999999999994,
      "speaker" : "Locutor 3",
      "start" : 75.829999999999998,
      "text" : "The name of your father..."
    },
    {
      "end" : 79.859999999999999,
      "speaker" : "Locutor 3",
      "start" : 77.459999999999994,
      "text" : "is Monkey D Dragon."
    },
    {
      "end" : 81.299999999999997,
      "speaker" : "Locutor 3",
      "start" : 79.859999999999999,
      "text" : "The revolutionary."
    },
    {
      "end" : 85.680000000000007,
      "speaker" : "Locutor 2",
      "start" : 84.170000000000002,
      "text" : "I don't really know that much about him."
    },
    {
      "end" : 88.859999999999999,
      "speaker" : "Locutor 2",
      "start" : 85.680000000000007,
      "text" : "I've never even seen his face before. What?"
    },
    {
      "end" : 90.900000000000006,
      "speaker" : "Locutor 1",
      "start" : 88.859999999999999,
      "text" : "But wait, this might be legit."
    },
    {
      "end" : 96.239999999999995,
      "speaker" : "Locutor 1",
      "start" : 90.900000000000006,
      "text" : "He doesn't come across as the kind of person who would lie, and he is a rather impressive pirate in his own way."
    },
    {
      "end" : 103.08,
      "speaker" : "Locutor 1",
      "start" : 96.239999999999995,
      "text" : "Plus, the vitality he's showed is the stuff of legends, an extraordinary father and an extraordinary son."
    },
    {
      "end" : 106.8,
      "speaker" : "Locutor 1",
      "start" : 103.08,
      "text" : "Please tell me, where did you come from? Huh?"
    },
    {
      "end" : 107.88,
      "speaker" : "Locutor 1",
      "start" : 106.8,
      "text" : "He's blue."
    },
    {
      "end" : 112.68000000000001,
      "speaker" : "Locutor 1",
      "start" : 110.75,
      "text" : "Sage Dragon."
    },
    {
      "end" : 114.95999999999999,
      "speaker" : "Locutor 1",
      "start" : 112.68000000000001,
      "text" : "When you step out for air."
    },
    {
      "end" : 121.16,
      "speaker" : "Locutor 1",
      "start" : 114.95999999999999,
      "text" : "You always seem to face in the same direction, no matter where we go. Do I?"
    },
    {
      "end" : 123.42,
      "speaker" : "Locutor 3",
      "start" : 121.16,
      "text" : "I suppose I never gave it much thought."
    },
    {
      "end" : 128.28,
      "speaker" : "Locutor 3",
      "start" : 123.89,
      "text" : "It's strange that you would bring it up, isn't it? Well,"
    },
    {
      "end" : 130.91999999999999,
      "speaker" : "Locutor 1",
      "start" : 128.28,
      "text" : "I wondered if it was some sort of homing instinct."
    },
    {
      "end" : 133.19999999999999,
      "speaker" : "Locutor 1",
      "start" : 130.91999999999999,
      "text" : "You know, the same thing animals have."
    },
    {
      "end" : 139.38,
      "speaker" : "Locutor 1",
      "start" : 134.56999999999999,
      "text" : "Thinking of home, perhaps some family in the East, maybe?"
    },
    {
      "end" : 142.19999999999999,
      "speaker" : "Locutor 3",
      "start" : 140.21000000000001,
      "text" : "That's enough."
    },
    {
      "end" : 143.88,
      "speaker" : "Locutor 3",
      "start" : 142.19999999999999,
      "text" : "Don't stick your nose in my past."
    },
    {
      "end" : 146.22,
      "speaker" : "Locutor 1",
      "start" : 144.47,
      "text" : "As you wish."
    },
    {
      "end" : 149.22,
      "speaker" : "Locutor 1",
      "start" : 147.41,
      "text" : "Hang on."
    },
    {
      "end" : 150.47999999999999,
      "speaker" : "Locutor 1",
      "start" : 149.22,
      "text" : "Oh, no."
    },
    {
      "end" : 153.06,
      "speaker" : "Locutor 1",
      "start" : 150.47999999999999,
      "text" : "If straw hat boy really is dragon son."
    },
    {
      "end" : 154.13999999999999,
      "speaker" : "Locutor 1",
      "start" : 153.06,
      "text" : "This could be a disaster."
    },
    {
      "end" : 157.08000000000001,
      "speaker" : "Locutor 1",
      "start" : 154.91,
      "text" : "Inazuma."
    },
    {
      "end" : 160.5,
      "speaker" : "Locutor 1",
      "start" : 157.08000000000001,
      "text" : "Check to see when they're taking Ace Boy away. Yes,"
    },
    {
      "end" : 161.2854375,
      "speaker" : null,
      "start" : 160.5,
      "text" : "of course."
    }
